<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>You are loving</l><l>And forgiving.</l><l>In our hearts You reside.</l><l>You are seeking</l><l>Man’s believing.</l><l>Let Your love through us shine.</l><l>Lord, may we love one another.</l><l>Gain the church of Your desire.</l><l>We’re revived to serve You</l><l>As we are filled with love.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>You love all men,</l><l>All Your children,</l><l>Even our enemies.</l><l>Lord, Your love will</l><l>Keep enduring</l><l>For all eternity.</l><l>Pour out Your love so prevailing,</l><l>All-inclusive love, unfailing.</l><l>Build us up together</l><l>In Your eternal love.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
